title: What Vic should change in the plan.
pid: e61acc25-6352-4396-80f9-0d24c01fc754
body: |2-
  Mark mission 1 built, and its first decision's last paragraph: "Nothing is
  lost: the node's headline under its parent carries the containment change" is
  true of the parent only. A grandparent that gained or lost the node shows that
  change only under itself, where its own content lists the node; the folder
  still leaves it out, as decided. Record the two decisions above where Libby
  and Tay asked them. The labels decision's list of what must follow missed
  'docs/COMMANDS.org' and 'docs/COMMANDS-nvim.org' (Doc's), whose containers
  entry now says "but for those the view already shows above it" and names the
  warning: the smallest change that kept them true.
